=== Composting ===
Placing vines into a [[composter]] has a 50% chance of raising the compost level by 1.

=== Color ===
The [[Block colors|coloration]] of vines is dependent on the [[biome]] they are in. A block always uses the color set to its location, regardless of how it was placed or of its source. In the inventory, vines have the color {{color|#48b518}}.

{{IN|BE}}, biome colors also appear on [[Map|maps]].<ref>{{Cite bug|MC|130658|Grass/foliage colors on maps still use the colors from Alpha v1.1.2_01 and earlier / do not change color with biomes|June 2, 2018}}</ref>

These values are generated by the biome dyeing algorithm. See [[biome colors]] for more information.
